WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Know Your Risk. Find out if your street floods and where the nearest higher ground is.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.950
Move Valuables Up. Lift documents, electronics and medicines to a higher place early.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.950
Stay Out Of Floodwater. Never walk or drive through floodwater. It can be deep, fast and contaminated.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Go To Higher Ground. Move to your meeting point or evacuation centre before the water rises.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.950
Switch Off Power. If water enters your home, switch off the main power if it is safe to do so.

